Kind: ablation
Issue: #607
Takes out: wake_dequeued() from the hand-off's wake of a waiter it does not switch to -- its own old copy leaves a stopped waiter TH_RUN on no run queue, and thread_setrun()s a swapped-out one
Run: --entry 25 600 -smp 4
Expect: handoff: WRONG
Expect: panic\(cpu

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/sched_prim.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/kern/sched_prim.c
